1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Mornes was born Anne Jensdatter 1902...her mother died soon after her birth (child birth problems?). She never got married, instead became a nurse in the Salvation Army, taking the name of the town she was bor
2 CONC n in, Mornes-old spelling. She might have been affected by the death of her mother's death after her birth...did she get into the medical field because of that?...Her grandmother died that same year also. We inherited about $750 1
2 CONC 971-72 from her after her death, here in America. My grandpa Julius Mornes and his brother Einar Mornes got $1500+- each divided amongst their children living here in Minnesota, USA.
