1 NAME Peter Andreas /Hansen/
2 GIVN Peter Andreas
2 SURN Hansen
2 _MARNM Ravik
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 MAY 1912
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
