2 DATE 1 JUL 1912
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 AUG 1942
2 PLAC Vornes
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
